## 4. AI for social, hype, and virality

### 4.1. Automatic highlight reels & shareable content

**Goal:** Turn sweaty matches into free marketing.

* Use AI to:

  * Detect hype moments in a match:

    * Tower down in last 5 seconds
    * Full-length comebacks
    * Smart predictions of “best play”
  * Auto-generate:

    * Short vertical clips (TikTok-style)
    * “Top 3 plays of your week”
* Inside app:

  * “Watch your highlight reel”
  * One-tap share to socials (no external editor needed)
* Monetization:

  * More organic installs = more people to sell passes, subs, and contracts.
  * Could gate some highlight editing features behind VIP.

